# --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/OptionsTest.lvl --user-dir .tmp/EditorFlows/ModsUser --mods --mod-dir Engine/Tests/Mods
# The options menu's Mods tab (MOD-6), first launch: the test mods load; turning one off saves the
# player's choice (user://Config/Mods.json), which applies at the next start (Mods02Restart).
wait-log UI/Options/Options.rml | 600
wait 10
assert-mod-loaded com.mitchengine.tests.blue-crates | 1
ui-click #tab-mods
wait 5
ui-assert-text #mod-toggle-com-mitchengine-tests-blue-crates | On
ui-assert-text #mod-status-com-mitchengine-tests-blue-crates | Loaded
ui-click #mod-toggle-com-mitchengine-tests-blue-crates
wait 5
ui-assert-text #mod-toggle-com-mitchengine-tests-blue-crates | Off
ui-assert-text #mod-status-com-mitchengine-tests-blue-crates | Unloads after a restart
screenshot .tmp/EditorFlows/Mods01Toggle.png
assert-mod-loaded com.mitchengine.tests.blue-crates | 1
